站"},{"href":"/essays/new-propulsion","title":"我们一直以来都知道的出口"},{"href":"/essays/reusable-launchers","title":"保留火箭"}]},{"id":"trajectory","name":"轨道","initial":"轨","definition":"航天器在空间中经过的路径，可以是开放的，也可以是闭合的，例如从地球到火星的弧线。","readMore":{"href":"/science/transfers/conic-sections","title":"圆锥曲线"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/essays/delta-v","title":"Delta-V的语法"},{"href":"/missions?id=apollo13","title":"Apollo 13"},{"href":"/science/mission-phases/tcm","title":"TCM — 轨道修正机动"},{"href":"/science/porkchop/what-is-a-porkchop","title":"什么是猪排图？"},{"href":"/essays/going-to-mars","title":"那面墙"}]},{"id":"orbiter","name":"轨道器","initial":"轨","definition":"进入绕行星、卫星或其他天体运行的轨道，从上方对其进行观测的航天器，往往一工作就是多年。","readMore":{"href":"/science/mission-phases/mission-types","title":"任务类型 — 飞掠、轨道器、着陆器、巡视器、采样返回"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/programs/viking","title":"Viking"},{"href":"/fleet?id=viking1-orbiter","title":"Viking 1 Orbiter"},{"href":"/missions?id=mars-express","title":"Mars Express"},{"href":"/science/planets/active-spacecraft-survey","title":"在役探测器概览"},{"href":"/essays/space-comm-arrays","title":"比耳语声更响亮"}]},{"id":"inclination","name":"轨道倾角","initial":"轨","definition":"轨道平面相对于参考平面（如地球赤道面或黄道面）的倾斜程度，以度为单位。","readMore":{"href":"/science/orbits/inclination","title":"轨道倾角"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/science/orbits/sun-synchronous","title":"太阳同步轨道与极地轨道——地球观测的支柱"},{"href":"/science/orbits/special-orbits","title":"特殊轨道 — Molniya、Tundra、GTO、冻结轨道"},{"href":"/fleet?id=molniya","title":"Molniya"},{"href":"/science/orbits/cislunar-orbits","title":"地月空间轨道 — DRO、NRHO、晕轨道、月球冻结轨道"}]},{"id":"rocket-equation","name":"火箭方程","initial":"火","definition":"齐奥尔科夫斯基公式 Δv = vₑ · ln(m₀/m₁)：由排气速度和推进剂在质量中所占比例，得出火箭能获得的速度变化。","readMore":{"href":"/science/propulsion/tsiolkovsky","title":"齐奥尔科夫斯基火箭方程"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/essays/delta-v","title":"Delta-V的语法"},{"href":"/essays/new-propulsion","title":"我们一直以来都知道的出口"},{"href":"/essays/asteroid-mining","title":"那错误的财富"},{"href":"/essays/interstellar-exploration","title":"诚实的算术"},{"href":"/science/history/tsiolkovsky-equation-1903","title":"齐奥尔科夫斯基方程 · 1903"}]},{"id":"hohmann-transfer","name":"霍曼转移","initial":"霍","definition":"两条圆轨道之间最省的转移方式：一次点火进入与两者相切的半个椭圆，到远端再点火一次进入圆轨道。","readMore":{"href":"/science/transfers/hohmann-transfer","title":"霍曼转移"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/essays/delta-v","title":"Delta-V的语法"},{"href":"/science/transfers/lambert-problem","title":"朗伯问题"},{"href":"/essays/going-to-mars","title":"那面墙"},{"href":"/essays/navigation","title":"在黑暗中寻找火星"}]},{"id":"stage","name":"级","initial":"级","definition":"火箭上自带发动机和推进剂的一节，推进剂用尽后即被抛弃。","readMore":{"href":"/science/propulsion/rocket-stages","title":"级 — 为何从无火箭以单级飞抵轨道"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/essays/reusable-launchers","title":"保留火箭"},{"href":"/science/propulsion/fuels-and-oxidizers","title":"燃料与氧化剂——煤油液氧、液氢液氧、甲烷液氧、自燃推进剂、固体推进剂"},{"href":"/fleet?id=new-glenn","title":"New Glenn"},{"href":"/science/propulsion/engine-clustering","title":"发动机集群 — Saturn V的5台 vs Starship的33台"}]},{"id":"polar-orbit","name":"极地轨道","initial":"极","definition":"经过两极上空或附近的轨道。地球在下方自转，航天器随时间推移可以看到整个地表。","readMore":{"href":"/science/orbits/inclination","title":"轨道倾角"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/science/orbits/sun-synchronous","title":"太阳同步轨道与极地轨道——地球观测的支柱"},{"href":"/missions?id=ulysses","title":"Ulysses"},{"href":"/science/planets/active-spacecraft-survey","title":"在役探测器概览"},{"href":"/fleet?id=bepicolombo","title":"BepiColombo"},{"href":"/fleet?id=oneweb","title":"OneWeb"}]},{"id":"splashdown","name":"溅落","initial":"溅","definition":"飞行的结束方式之一：返回舱在降落伞下落入海中，再由打捞船回收。","readMore":{"href":"/science/mission-phases/edl","title":"EDL — 进入、下降、着陆"},"usedOn":[{"href":"/missions?id=apollo-soyuz","title":"Apollo-Soyuz测试计划（ASTP）"},{"href":"/missions?id=skylab-4","title":"Skylab 4"},{"href":"/missions?id=gemini3","title":"Gemini 3 / GT-3"},{"href":"/missions?id=freedom-7","title":"Freedom 7 / MR-3"},{"href":"/missions?id=friendship-7","title":"Friendship 7 / MA-6"}]},{"id":"rendezvous","name":"交会","initial":"交","definition":"使两个航天器在同一地点以相同速度飞行，从而并肩飞行，通常是对接之前的一步。","rea